<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>歌尔股份 ROI/ROA/ROIC/WACC/EVA 分析</title>
<style>
body { margin:0; font-family:"Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif; color:#1e2a30; background:#f4f7f8; }
.bar { height:6px; background:#1f9d8a; }
main { width:min(1180px, calc(100% - 36px)); margin:0 auto; padding:32px 0 56px; }
section { margin-top:22px; padding:28px; background:#fff; border:1px solid #d9e2e6; border-radius:8px; }
.hero { min-height:360px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.4fr .9fr; gap:28px; align-items:center; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff,#eef7f5); }
h1 { margin:0 0 16px; color:#123047; font-size:48px; line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:0; }
h2 { margin:0 0 8px; color:#123047; font-size:28px; letter-spacing:0; }
p { line-height:1.65; }
.lead { color:#60717b; font-size:19px; }
.metrics { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr); gap:14px; margin-top:22px; }
.card { padding:16px; border:1px solid #d9e2e6; border-radius:8px; background:#fff; }
.label { color:#60717b; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; }
.value { margin-top:5px; color:#123047; font-size:27px; font-weight:800; white-space:nowrap; }
.teal { color:#1f9d8a; } .green { color:#2e7d32; } .orange { color:#e58c2a; }
table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; min-width:760px; } th,td { padding:14px 16px; border-bottom:1px solid #d9e2e6; text-align:right; white-space:nowrap; } th:first-child,td:first-child { text-align:left; } th { color:#123047; background:#f8fbfc; }
.wrap { overflow-x:auto; }
.grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:22px; }
.pos { color:#2e7d32; font-weight:700; } .neg { color:#c7473a; font-weight:700; }
svg { width:100%; height:auto; display:block; }
.quote { margin-top:20px; padding:18px; border:1px solid #a8dcd4; border-radius:8px; background:#f0faf8; color:#1f9d8a; text-align:center; font-size:20px; font-weight:800; }
@media (max-width:900px) { .hero,.grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .metrics { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); } h1 { font-size:34px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bar"></div>
<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <p class="lead">歌尔股份 | 2023-2025 年报口径</p>
      <h1>资本回报与价值创造分析</h1>
      <p class="lead">结论先行：关注点不是单纯收入规模，而是 ROIC 是否持续跑赢 WACC，以及 EVA 是否转正并扩大。</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="card"><div class="label">2025 ROIC</div><div class="value teal">14.25%</div></div>
      <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px"><div class="label">2025 WACC</div><div class="value orange">7.40%</div></div>
      <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px"><div class="label">2025 EVA</div><div class="value green">21.28 亿元</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>核心指标总览</h2>
    <p class="lead">老板视角：每一元资本投进去后，是否真正超过了资金成本。</p>
    <div class="wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>年度</th><th>ROI</th><th>ROA</th><th>ROIC</th><th>WACC</th><th>EVA</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>2023</td>
          <td>3.65%</td>
          <td>1.35%</td>
          <td>4.78%</td>
          <td>7.87%</td>
          <td class="neg">-8.60 亿元</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td>2024</td>
          <td>8.95%</td>
          <td>3.31%</td>
          <td>10.80%</td>
          <td>7.58%</td>
          <td class="pos">9.29 亿元</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td>2025</td>
          <td>12.34%</td>
          <td>4.42%</td>
          <td>14.25%</td>
          <td>7.40%</td>
          <td class="pos">21.28 亿元</td>
        </tr></tbody></table></div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>关键拐点：ROIC 跑赢 WACC</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 620 340" aria-label="ROIC 和 WACC 趋势">
          <line x1="60" y1="280" x2="560" y2="280" stroke="#d9e2e6"/>
          <line x1="60" y1="60" x2="60" y2="280" stroke="#d9e2e6"/>
          <polyline points="60,248 310,144 560,85" fill="none" stroke="#1f9d8a" stroke-width="4"/>
          <polyline points="60,127 310,151 560,166" fill="none" stroke="#e58c2a" stroke-width="4"/>
          <circle cx="60" cy="248" r="5" fill="#1f9d8a"/>
<circle cx="310" cy="144" r="5" fill="#1f9d8a"/>
<circle cx="560" cy="85" r="5" fill="#1f9d8a"/>
          <circle cx="60" cy="127" r="5" fill="#e58c2a"/>
<circle cx="310" cy="151" r="5" fill="#e58c2a"/>
<circle cx="560" cy="166" r="5" fill="#e58c2a"/>
          <text x="60" y="315" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Microsoft YaHei" font-size="14" fill="#60717b">2023</text>
<text x="310" y="315" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Microsoft YaHei" font-size="14" fill="#60717b">2024</text>
<text x="560" y="315" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Microsoft YaHei" font-size="14" fill="#60717b">2025</text>
        </svg>
        <p><span class="teal">■ ROIC</span>　<span class="orange">■ WACC</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>汇报话术</h3>
        <p>ROIC 是经营回报，WACC 是资金成本。ROIC 高于 WACC，才说明公司真的在创造价值。</p>
        <p>2023 年若 ROIC 低于 WACC，代表账面盈利但经济利润承压；后续若 ROIC 越过 WACC，代表价值创造能力改善。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>EVA：扣除资金成本后的经济利润</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 620 340" aria-label="EVA 柱状图">
          <line x1="60" y1="220" x2="560" y2="220" stroke="#60717b"/>
          <rect x="108" y="205" width="75" height="55" fill="#c7473a"/>
<text x="145" y="195" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Microsoft YaHei" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#c7473a">-8.60</text>
<rect x="258" y="146" width="75" height="59" fill="#2e7d32"/>
<text x="295" y="136" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Microsoft YaHei" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#2e7d32">9.29</text>
<rect x="408" y="70" width="75" height="135" fill="#2e7d32"/>
<text x="445" y="60" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Microsoft YaHei" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#2e7d32">21.28</text>
          <text x="60" y="315" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Microsoft YaHei" font-size="14" fill="#60717b">2023</text>
<text x="310" y="315" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Microsoft YaHei" font-size="14" fill="#60717b">2024</text>
<text x="560" y="315" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Microsoft YaHei" font-size="14" fill="#60717b">2025</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>非财务解释</h3>
        <p>EVA 为负，意思是赚到的钱还没覆盖资本成本；EVA 转正，才是真正给股东创造超额回报。</p>
        <p>如果 EVA 持续扩大，说明利润质量和资本效率同步改善。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="quote">一句话总结：歌尔股份 正在从“利润修复”进入“资本效率驱动的价值创造”。</div>
  </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
